@startuml
title UC13 - Consultar favoritos (SD)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left

actor "Utilizador" as U
participant ":HomeActivity" as H
participant ":FavoritesActivity" as A
participant ":UserSession" as S
participant ":FavoriteRepository" as R
participant "RestDB" as DB <<externo>>
participant ":BookAdapter" as AD

U -> H: clica em "Favoritos"
H -> A: startActivity()
activate A
A -> A: onResume()
A -> A: carregarFavoritos()
A -> S: getUserId()
S --> A: uid
A -> R: getFavorites(uid, callback)
activate R
R -> DB: GET /favorites?q={"userId":uid}
DB --> R: 200 OK (List<Favorite>)
R --> A: onSuccess(List<Favorite>)
deactivate R
loop por cada favorito
  A -> A: favoriteBooks.add(favorite.toBook())
end
A -> AD: notifyDataSetChanged()
A --> U: mostra os favoritos
deactivate A
note over U, AD: ao clicar num favorito abre os detalhes (UC2);\nao voltar, o onResume() recarrega a lista
@enduml
